      "text": [
        "883 - وَقَالَ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ: «مَنْ أَذَّنَ سَبْعَ سِنِينَ مُحْتَسِباً جَاءَ يَوْمَ اَلْقِيَامَةِ لاَ ذَنْبَ لَهُ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.883 - Imam (as) said:\n\"Whoever calls the adhan (call to prayer) for seven years with the intention of seeking Allah’s (swt) reward will come on the Day of Judgment without any sins.\""
        ]
      }
